  "title": "Brain processes cause intentionality",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "f56e4992-7086-4189-81da-e7302ee75305",
      "text": "Intentionality in human beings and animals is a product of causal features of the brain. Searle takes this as an empirical fact about the actual causal relations between mental processes and brains: certain brain processes are sufficient for intentionality.",
